message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "conserved-domain-hyperuniformity: analysis code and data"
abstract: >-
  Structure-factor, number-variance and variance-budget analysis of
  Cahn-Hilliard coarsening, showing that the concentration field is
  hyperuniform while the point pattern of domain centroids is not, and
  that weighting the points by domain solute mass restores hyperuniformity.
